    "title": "Find my stuff: Home inventory",
    "description": "Find my stuff: Home inventory helps you keep your things organized, and it's totally free!\r\n\r\nTo get started, you just need to think of a name (Bedroom, maybe?), take a photo (optional), and hit OK. Then, get inside your new creation and start adding more stuff to keep it in order. As simple as that!\r\n\r\nYou can use it for things like:\r\n- List everything that you have stored and you don't usually use, but that you may need in the future\r\n- Indicate the correct place for those things you use more often\r\n- Are you lending anything to a friend? Create an item with her or his name and put it there!\r\n- Family or friends at your house while you're out? Export a list of your things to share it with them!\r\n- If your inventory requires a structure based on barcodes or QRs, you have a Barcode scanner and a QR scanner available!\r\n- Add custom tags to your items to classify them and filter by categories quickly and efficiently.\r\n\r\nAll of this for free, and you can use it offline! (Internet is only required for backups on Google Drive).",
